--!nonstrict
-- Aero7: core/NavSprites - HD sprite sheet for the Explorer Back / Forward orbs and the glass frame beneath them.
-- Orbs are rendered from the supplied vector artwork (4x, 25x26 logical px per orb); the frame follows the
-- Windows 7 ExplorerFrame "Frame" bitmap (peanut-shaped glass capsule, 61x30 logical px).
--
-- Sheet layout (400x328 px, 4x scale):
--   row 0 (y = 0)   : Back    -> Default | Hover | Pressed | Disabled   (cells 100x104)
--   row 1 (y = 104) : Forward -> Default | Hover | Pressed | Disabled   (cells 100x104)
--   row 2 (y = 208) : Frame   -> 244x120 at x = 0
-- Requires getcustomasset + writefile (executor); GetSheetAsset() returns nil otherwise so callers can fall back
-- to the pure-UI orbs.

